# ==========================================
# 1. Rust / Cargo Outputs (Absolute Must)
# ==========================================
# This ignores the massive /target directory where Rust compiles your binaries
/target/

# ==========================================
# 2. Operating System Files
# ==========================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp

# ==========================================
# 3. Personal Notes & Learning Markdown files
# ==========================================
# OPTION A: Ignore ALL markdown files in the project...
*.md

# ...BUT keep your main portfolio README.md file so GitHub can display it!
!README.md

/notes/